  "html": "\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull work-detail has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide work-detail__layout is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group work-detail__header is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\t\t\t<h1 class=\"work-detail__title wp-block-post-title\">風色幻想 NeXus 遊戲主題曲《風色的軌跡》</h1>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"taxonomy-work_category work-detail__categories wp-block-post-terms\"><a href=\"/work-category/music/\" rel=\"tag\">MUSIC</a></div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<p class=\"work-detail__year work-year wp-block-paragraph\">2025</p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<figure data-cover-orientation=\"landscape\" class=\"work-detail__hero wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img width=\"1920\" height=\"1358\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fantasia-sango-nexus-cover.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-post-image\" alt=\"風色幻想 NeXus 遊戲主題曲《風色的軌跡》\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fantasia-sango-nexus-cover.webp 1920w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fantasia-sango-nexus-cover-300x212.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fantasia-sango-nexus-cover-1024x724.webp 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fantasia-sango-nexus-cover-768x543.webp 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fantasia-sango-nexus-cover-1536x1086.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" /></figure>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group work-detail__content has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-content work-detail__post-content wp-block-post-content has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-post-content-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Credits</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n\n<li>Vocals |</li>\n\n\n<li>杏仁ミル</li>\n\n\n<li>兔姬</li>\n\n\n<li>塔芭絲可‬</li>\n\n\n<li>黑銀夜烏</li>\n\n\n<li>製作人 | Aaron Aranas</li>\n\n\n<li>作詞 | 郭沛昱</li>\n\n\n<li>作曲 | Aaron Aranas</li>\n\n\n<li>編曲 | Aaron Aranas、陳柏豪</li>\n\n\n<li>吉他、貝斯演奏 | 陳柏豪</li>\n\n\n<li>合聲編寫 | Aaron Aranas、陳柏豪</li>\n\n\n<li>合聲演唱 | 可蕾</li>\n\n\n<li>配唱製作人 | 陳柏豪</li>\n\n\n<li>人聲錄音師 | 李晨安 @智冠音樂多媒體中心、廖彥智 @耳多癢音樂、維尼 @紫外線工作室</li>\n\n\n<li>弦樂編寫 | Aaron Aranas</li>\n\n\n<li>弦樂製譜 | 陽惟恩(Wayne Yang)</li>\n\n\n<li>弦樂演奏 | 蔡依芸(Violin1)、謝正煒(Violin2)、林楷訓(Viola)、鄭宇彤(Cello)</li>\n\n\n<li>弦樂錄音師 | 李晨安</li>\n\n\n<li>弦樂錄音室 | 智冠錄音室</li>\n\n\n<li>混音 | 蘇昱嘉</li>\n\n\n<li>母帶後製 | 陳柏豪</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n\n</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"work-media\"><section class=\"work-media__section work-detail-audio\" data-work-detail-audio data-playlist-work-id=\"103\" data-playlist-title=\"風色幻想 NeXus 遊戲主題曲《風色的軌跡》\" aria-labelledby=\"work-detail-audio-103\"><h2 id=\"work-detail-audio-103\" class=\"work-detail-audio__title\">風色幻想 NeXus 遊戲主題曲《風色的軌跡》</h2><div class=\"work-detail-audio__now\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"724\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fantasia-sango-nexus-cover-1024x724.webp\" class=\"work-detail-audio__artwork\" alt=\"風色幻想 NeXus 遊戲主題曲《風色的軌跡》\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fantasia-sango-nexus-cover-1024x724.webp 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fantasia-sango-nexus-cover-300x212.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fantasia-sango-nexus-cover-768x543.webp 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fantasia-sango-nexus-cover-1536x1086.webp 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fantasia-sango-nexus-cover.webp 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /><div class=\"work-detail-audio__current\"><p class=\"work-detail-audio__eyebrow\">NOW PLAYING</p><p class=\"work-detail-audio__current-title\">風色的軌跡</p><div class=\"work-detail-audio__controls\"><div class=\"work-detail-audio__transport\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Playback controls\"><button type=\"button\" data-work-detail-audio-action=\"previous\" aria-label=\"Previous track\">◀</button><button type=\"button\" d